// Bank Recovery System — Google Sheets Live Sync Script
// Instructions:
//   1. Open your Google Sheet
//   2. Click Extensions → Apps Script
//   3. Delete all existing code, paste this entire script
//   4. Click Save (💾), then Deploy → New Deployment
